      "options": {
        "content": "The threshold is a **number for each database**, not one fleet-wide MB value. Warning SMS (P1) fires when the log file grows more than **10% of that database's current log size** in 24 hours. Critical SMS (P0) fires above **25%**. Growth under **64 MB** is ignored.\n\nExample: a 100 GB log warns at 10 GB and pages critically at 25 GB. A 4 GB log warns at 400 MB and pages critically at 1 GB. `master`, `model`, `msdb`, and `tempdb` are excluded. A planned log expand matches the same rule. Source metric: `mssql_database_log_size_mb`.",
